  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Banvivienda Agricultural Financing Partnership</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed loan for Banco Paname&#xf1;o de la Vivienda (&quot;Banvivienda&quot;) is for up to US$25 million to support the growth of its agricultural and livestock client base in Panama. The objective of this transaction is to support Banvivienda in financing its agricultural and livestock clients, of which the majority are small and medium size-enterprises (&#x201c;SMEs&#x201d;), mainly in the regions of Chiriqu&#xed;, Azuero, and Darien. The term of the IDB Invest Loan is expected to be up to 5 years, including one year of grace. The Loan will be complemented by IDB Invest Technical Assistance to support Banvivienda&#x2019;s agricultural and livestock client base in implementing Climate Smart Agriculture practices, including energy efficiency measures, renewable energy solutions, water and irrigation systems, among others.</narrative>
  </description>
